<title>USA: Sun Co Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Sun Co Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOURTH QUARTER				1996		 1995</p>
<p> Revenues			  $3,027,000,000    $2,439,000,000</p>
<p>Income (Loss) from Continuing</p>
<p>  Operations			(224,000,000)	   1,000,000</p>
<p>Income from Discontinued</p>
<p>  Operations				    ---	  17,000,000</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		(224,000,000)	  18,000,000</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) per Share</p>
<p>  of Common Stock(A)(B)		  (3.22)		  0.09</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number of</p>
<p>Common Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>  (In Millions)				73.0		  74.5</p>
<p>TWELVE MONTHS</p>
<p> Revenues			  11,300,000,000     9,877,000,000</p>
<p>Loss from Continuing Operations</p>
<p>before Cumulative Effect</p>
<p>of Change in Accounting</p>
<p>  Principle			 (281,000,000)	 (8,000,000)</p>
<p>Income from Discontinued</p>
<p>  Operations			  166,000,000	 235,000,000</p>
<p>Cumulative Effect of Change</p>
<p>  in Accounting Principle		   ---	(87,000,000)</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		(115,000,000)	 140,000,000</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) per Share</p>
<p>  of Common Stock(A)(B)		  (2.17)		  1.29</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number of</p>
<p>Common Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>  (In Millions)				73.6		  91.3</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 fourth quarter and year include $201 million after-tax charges, including: $80 million for reconfiguration of Puerto Rico Refinery; $85 million for off-take agreement to purchase MBTE; $36 million environmental remediation related write-downs.</p>
<p>Excluding charges, fourth quarter operating loss was $23 million or $0.47 per share.</p>
<p>(A)  After provision for dividends on preference shares.</p>
<p>(B)  Represents both primary and fully diluted earnings per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
